Description: GdkPixbuf loader and thumbnailer for DDS (DirectDraw Surface) images
 Adds a gdk-pixbuf loader module so image viewers (ristretto, eog, gthumb),
 file managers (Thunar via tumbler), and any GdkPixbuf-based application can
 open and thumbnail .dds textures.
 .
 Supports DXT1/BC1, DXT3/BC2, DXT5/BC3, the DX10 extended header
 (BC1/BC2/BC3, R8G8B8A8, B8G8R8A8), uncompressed RGB/RGBA with arbitrary
 bitmasks, and luminance formats. Ships dds.thumbnailer so tumbler and
 other freedesktop thumbnailer stacks pick it up.

